sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Remote repository
    participant S as localiser sync
    participant L as Local bundle store

    Note over S: you run: sync blender 5.2

    rect rgb(244, 246, 248)
        Note over R,L: 1. Resolve the version
        alt override variable is set
            Note over S: use the override version
        else normal case
            S->>R: read config.json
            alt remote reachable
                R-->>S: studio config
                S->>L: refresh last-known copy
            else offline
                L-->>S: last-known config
            end
            Note over S: look up version for blender 5.2
        end
    end

    rect rgb(244, 246, 248)
        Note over R,L: 2. Make sure it is installed locally
        S->>L: .complete marker present?
        alt already installed
            L-->>S: reuse it, no network
        else not installed
            S->>L: lock, clear partial folder
            R-->>S: manifest.json and pipeline.zip
            Note over S: verify sha256
            Note over S: extract, check python_root
            S->>L: write .complete, rename into place
        end
    end

    rect rgb(244, 246, 248)
        Note over R,L: 3. Select it for future sessions
        S->>L: write prepared selection
    end

    Note over S: Prepared. Restart the DCC to use it
